    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE THE DUNGEON AS THE ALCHEMIST WITCH</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/40f76ed68cb0d1806d6bb942bcc4fe57.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/40f76ed68cb0d1806d6bb942bcc4fe57.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/40f76ed68cb0d1806d6bb942bcc4fe57.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>D.A.D. (Deep Alchemy Dungeon) is a third-person role-playing game in which you explore a dangerous dungeon full of magic and mysteries in a classic medieval setting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK NEW MAGIC POTION RECIPES</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/b3a29e62d1796d37a88250124524e0ed.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/b3a29e62d1796d37a88250124524e0ed.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/b3a29e62d1796d37a88250124524e0ed.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Collect ingredients and find recipes, because alchemy is the most effective way to move deeper into the dungeon and discover new secrets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME A MASTER OF THE ELEMENTS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d5c243f46e7403edd822786d21626bf.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d5c243f46e7403edd822786d21626bf.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d5c243f46e7403edd822786d21626bf.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Potions can be consumed, mixed, thrown at enemies, poured onto objects.  And not all mixtures work as common sense would suggest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN ALCHEMY INTO A DEATH WEAPONS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/c3e6a4b48ef7b0ccd7bd2f5ca50e3c10.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/c3e6a4b48ef7b0ccd7bd2f5ca50e3c10.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/c3e6a4b48ef7b0ccd7bd2f5ca50e3c10.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your enemies will feel the full power of ancient knowledge. Your superiority is the mastery of your alchemical skills to be reckoned with.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE THE DUNGEON AS THE ALCHEMIST WITCH</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/40f76ed68cb0d1806d6bb942bcc4fe57.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/40f76ed68cb0d1806d6bb942bcc4fe57.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/40f76ed68cb0d1806d6bb942bcc4fe57.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>D.A.D. (Deep Alchemy Dungeon) is a third-person role-playing game in which you explore a dangerous dungeon full of magic and mysteries in a classic medieval setting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK NEW MAGIC POTION RECIPES</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/b3a29e62d1796d37a88250124524e0ed.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/b3a29e62d1796d37a88250124524e0ed.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/b3a29e62d1796d37a88250124524e0ed.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Collect ingredients and find recipes, because alchemy is the most effective way to move deeper into the dungeon and discover new secrets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME A MASTER OF THE ELEMENTS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d5c243f46e7403edd822786d21626bf.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d5c243f46e7403edd822786d21626bf.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/9d5c243f46e7403edd822786d21626bf.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Potions can be consumed, mixed, thrown at enemies, poured onto objects.  And not all mixtures work as common sense would suggest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN ALCHEMY INTO A DEATH WEAPONS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/c3e6a4b48ef7b0ccd7bd2f5ca50e3c10.poster.avif?t=1726064527\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/c3e6a4b48ef7b0ccd7bd2f5ca50e3c10.webm?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2024820/extras/c3e6a4b48ef7b0ccd7bd2f5ca50e3c10.mp4?t=1726064527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your enemies will feel the full power of ancient knowledge. Your superiority is the mastery of your alchemical skills to be reckoned with.",
